    "detailed_feedback_1": "There was a time where I saw multiple spirals on the sides of my screen, but not this many. I also didn't notice that there was a bright light in the center, as it was just dark red for me the whole time. I did experience some of these shapes in the experiment, but not all of them at the same time. There was maybe at most 2-3 spirals on my screen, but I did not have this many. The shape of it and how it is going, it reminded me of the spirals that I saw on the experiment.",
