    "content_2": "8",
    "overall_2": "6",
    "detailed_feedback_2": "I witnessed all of these effects, but not at the same time. They all had things that I saw during the experiment, such as the spiral in the middle made up of other tiny circles, the spirals on the side of the screen, and just the circles in general. The color of the background was a pretty deep red, compared to this one and there wasn't a black circle in the middle of the screen.",
