    "detailed_feedback_3": "This one has some shape similarities and has the same idea of what I saw during the experiment. Some of these shapes, such as the eyes spiral in the middle, the other spirals, and the circles, were all things that I witnessed during the experiment. The \"eyes\" were not there in the experiment and instead, they were just black dots with no white outer. The spirals are somewhat alike, especially the 2 bottom right spirals. That is what I witnessed in the experiment, but again, not all of these at the same time."
